{
  "_comment": [
    "Committed destination schema for the offline apply-conformance harness (T081, AD054).",
    "It is a data file rather than a Python fixture on purpose: the harness asserts the mutation",
    "the SDK renders, so the schema it renders against has to be a fixed, reviewable input that a",
    "later edit to a test helper cannot quietly reshape.",
    "Four kinds, each carrying one property the harness needs:",
    "  ConfSite  - an all-direct human-friendly ID, and a `comment` attribute no payload writes;",
    "  ConfTag   - a second all-direct kind, so a peer set has something to point at;",
    "  ConfTeam  - an all-direct kind with a cardinality-many relationship, for the replace-set;",
    "  ConfDevice- a human-friendly ID that CROSSES A RELATIONSHIP, which cannot render keyed",
    "              today and is the xfail(strict=True) arm (AD067)."
  ],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "conformance-site",
      "name": "Site",
      "namespace": "Conf",
      "label": "Site",
      "default_filter": "name__value",
      "human_friendly_id": ["name__value"],
      "attributes": [
        {"id": "conf-site-name", "name": "name", "kind": "Text", "optional": false, "unique": true},
        {"id": "conf-site-description", "name": "description", "kind": "Text", "optional": true, "unique": false},
        {"id": "conf-site-comment", "name": "comment", "kind": "Text", "optional": true, "unique": false}
      ],
      "relationships": []
    },
    {
      "id": "conformance-tag",
      "name": "Tag",
      "namespace": "Conf",
      "label": "Tag",
      "default_filter": "name__value",
      "human_friendly_id": ["name__value"],
      "attributes": [
        {"id": "conf-tag-name", "name": "name", "kind": "Text", "optional": false, "unique": true}
      ],
      "relationships": []
    },
    {
      "id": "conformance-team",
      "name": "Team",
      "namespace": "Conf",
      "label": "Team",
      "default_filter": "name__value",
      "human_friendly_id": ["name__value"],
      "attributes": [
        {"id": "conf-team-name", "name": "name", "kind": "Text", "optional": false, "unique": true}
      ],
      "relationships": [
        {
          "id": "conf-team-members",
          "name": "members",
          "peer": "ConfTag",
          "cardinality": "many",
          "kind": "Generic",
          "optional": true,
          "identifier": "conf_team__members"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "conformance-device",
      "name": "Device",
      "namespace": "Conf",
      "label": "Device",
      "default_filter": "name__value",
      "human_friendly_id": ["site__name__value", "name__value"],
      "attributes": [
        {"id": "conf-device-name", "name": "name", "kind": "Text", "optional": false, "unique": true}
      ],
      "relationships": [
        {
          "id": "conf-device-site",
          "name": "site",
          "peer": "ConfSite",
          "cardinality": "one",
          "kind": "Attribute",
          "optional": false,
          "identifier": "conf_device__site"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
